    "sections": {
        "description": "The Career Counseling Theme is a comprehensive, professional, and fully responsive solution designed for career counselors, educational platforms, online coaching websites, training institutes, HR consultants, life coaches, and career development service providers looking to offer counseling sessions, digital products, or membership plans online. Perfect for guiding students, professionals, job seekers, and career changers, the theme features intelligent assessment tools including career interest tests, aptitude evaluations, personality assessments, skill-based recommendations, and career mapping to help users make informed career choices. It supports personalized reports, progress tracking, job readiness evaluations, resume building, interview preparation, career goal setting, skill development, and industry exploration, ensuring alignment with current job market trends. Built with LearnPress for seamless course and counseling integration, and compatible with WooCommerce for selling online courses, career tests, counseling plans, eBooks, and memberships, it also integrates Contact Form 7 for appointment bookings, inquiries, and lead generation, and Yoast SEO for improved search visibility. With an intuitive design, interactive dashboards, and customizable layouts, the Career Counseling Theme engages users, fosters self-awareness, boosts confidence, and supports long-term career growth, making it ideal for high school students, recent graduates, or mid-career professionals seeking actionable guidance and successful career outcomes. Demo: https://preview.wpelemento.com/career-counseling/"
    },
